id: minion-coordinator-second-effect
name: Minion Coordinator
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: minion-coordinator
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Minion Coordinator's second effect, as a Maneuver: one of your Minions Superior until the end of their turn.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, select one of your Minions. That Minion enters the Superior State until the end of their turn.

---

# Which of your Minions, asked - Superior till the end of its turn, on its own clock (chat.mjs coordinateMinion).
[on used]
coordinateMinion();
